cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its example data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Constrained GIWAXS peak fitting"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible workflow for constrained peak fitting of one-dimensional GIWAXS
  line profiles. It compares Gaussian, Lorentzian and pseudo-Voigt line shapes by
  BIC within local q-windows, tests each component by leave-one-component-out
  refitting, and separates internal fitted values from values that pass explicit
  reporting gates.
